{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-map-render-013-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/MapMarkerRendererTests.cs", "line": 304, "method": "ClickLogLine_RightButtonToggleOn_LoggedUnderMapMarkerTagWithButton", "category": "T3", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MapMarkerRenderer.cs; change the production click site to log under a different tag -> test stays green, because the test issues ParsekLog.Info with the MapMarker tag itself", "what_it_asserts": "That the right-click toggle log line is emitted under the MapMarker tag with button and sticky state.", "why_weak": "The tag and the emit are both supplied by the test; only FormatClickLogLine is production, and its content is already pinned by FormatClickLogLine_RightButtonToggleOn_IncludesButtonAndStickyOn.", "proposed_action": "Rename to say it pins the ParsekLog tag format, or drop it as redundant with the formatter test since the real emit site needs a live Unity GUI.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
