{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "MapMarkerRenderer", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/MapMarkerRenderer.cs", "sut_line": 1, "case_kind": "boundary", "proposed_name": "ComputeHandlerHitRect_UsesClickPadding_AndIsNarrowerThanToggleRect", "sketch": "Expose or use the production handler-rect helper and assert toggleRect strictly contains handlerRect for the same icon rect, reading both paddings from production constants.", "guards": "A change to either padding constant that collapses the right-click widening back onto the handler rect (the fast-warp clickability fix) would be caught.", "risk": "ui"}
